emiah.10.22\">Je 10:22</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:46\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.46\">51:46</a> + (<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּאָה</span> om.) v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:46\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.46\">46</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּבוֹא שׁ׳ אֶל־שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.26\">Ez 7:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ יְבַהֲלֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:44\" href=\"/Daniel.11.44\">Dn 11:44</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמוּעָתֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.1\">Is 53:1</a> <em>the report that reached us</em>, cf. also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.9\">Is 28:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.14\">Je 49:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:1\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.1\">Ob 1</a> (De Du al. specif. of prophetic message, but v. Gie <sup>Beiträge 155 f.</sup> We Now <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:1\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.1\">Ob 1</a>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>mention</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא הֽיְתָה סְדֹם לִשׁ׳ בְּפִיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:56\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.56\">Ez 16:56</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB10380","strong_numbers":["8052"],"next_hw":"שַׁמּוּעַ","prev_hw":"שִׁמְעָתִים","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["9019"],"TWOT":["2412d"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}